# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Real Firebase config — see SETUP_FIREBASE.md. Only the .example placeholders
# committed above are tracked; these real files are dropped in locally.
/android/app/google-services.json
/ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Release signing secrets — never commit these. See android/key.properties.example.
/android/key.properties
/android/app/upload-keystore.jks
/android/**/upload-keystore.jks

